# Origin of the FastAPI telemetry service. Read at BUILD time, not run time:
# changing it means rebuilding, and on Vercel that means a redeploy.
#
# Dev:  leave unset. Vite proxies /api and /ws to TELEMETRY_ORIGIN
#       (default http://127.0.0.1:8000), so the browser stays same-origin.
# Prod: set it to the service origin. Must be https when the dashboard itself
#       is served over https, or the browser blocks the socket as mixed content.
#       Only the origin is used; any path is ignored.
VITE_TELEMETRY_URL=https://telemetry.example.com
